{"id":"62294d1c4025d5d8","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-pra.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Arithmetic","display":"df-pra — Primitive Recursive Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-pra","aliases":["90-df-pra"],"display":"df-pra — Primitive Recursive Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-pra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-pra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pra — Primitive Recursive Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" href=\"?note=4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" title=\"90-df-peano-arithmetic\">90-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"93165ca56749f325\" href=\"?note=93165ca56749f325\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations\">90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}},a(d),⟦ d⟧\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}},a(d),⟦ d⟧\\)</span> 及描述构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"93165ca56749f325\" href=\"?note=93165ca56749f325\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations\">90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F_d)_{d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\">\\((F_d)_{d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\)</span> 是给定单射符号族，与原签名、变量和逻辑符号不交；其元数在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 遍历长度等于相应元数的互异变量列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,u\">\\(x,y,u\\)</span> 为变量；递归方程要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\}\">\\(u\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Distinct},\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Distinct},\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span>、公式与有限量词列取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>，推导呈示与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\">\\(\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" href=\"?note=4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" title=\"90-df-peano-arithmetic\">90-df-peano-arithmetic</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{PR}}\">\\(L_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\)</span> 上的同一实例。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>所有下式方程先作为对象公式构造，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\)</span> 取全称闭包；没有把这些方程当作元理论中新添的算术等式公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOL}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOL}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRA}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Func}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_{L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\{F_d:d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\cup\\{(F_d,a(d)):d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\},\\\\\nL_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathrm{Func}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}},\n\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}},\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{arity}(F_d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_d),\\\\\n\\mathrm{QF}(L_{\\mathrm{PR}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}:\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\subseteq X\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi)\\in X)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{QF}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{QF}(L_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}^k:\n\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(\\vec x)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Func}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_{L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\{F_d:d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\cup\\{(F_d,a(d)):d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\},\\\\\nL_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathrm{Func}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}},\n\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}},\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{arity}(F_d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{arity}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_d),\\\\\n\\mathrm{QF}(L_{\\mathrm{PR}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}:\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\subseteq X\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi)\\in X)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{QF}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{QF}(L_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}^k:\n\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(\\vec x)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_Z&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{Z^*}(x)=0):x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\},\\\\\nE_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{S^*}(x)=S(x)):x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\},\\\\\nE_\\Pi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{\\Pi^*_{i,k}}(\\vec x)=x_{i-1}):\nk\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\},\\\\\nE_C&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\n(F_{C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m)}(\\vec x)=F_d(F_{e_1}(\\vec x),\\ldots,F_{e_m}(\\vec x))):\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}m,k\\ge1\\land d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\n\\land a(d)=m\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ a(e_i)=k)\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\},\\\\\nE_{R,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{R(d,e)}(\\vec x,0)=F_d(\\vec x)):\nk\\ge1\\land d,e\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\land a(d)=k\\land a(e)=k+2\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\},\\\\\nE_{R,S}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\n(F_{R(d,e)}(\\vec x,S(u))=F_e(\\vec x,u,F_{R(d,e)}(\\vec x,u))):\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}k\\ge1\\land d,e\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\land a(d)=k\\land a(e)=k+2\n\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\setminus\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\}\\},\\\\\nE_{+,\\times}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(\\theta):\nx,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\land x\\ne y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\theta\\in\\{x+0=x,\\ x+S(y)=S(x+y),\\ x\\times0=0,\\ x\\times S(y)=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq E_Z\\cup E_S\\cup E_\\Pi\\cup E_C\\cup E_{R,0}\\cup E_{R,S}\\cup E_{+,\\times}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_Z&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{Z^*}(x)=0):x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\},\\\\\nE_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{S^*}(x)=S(x)):x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\},\\\\\nE_\\Pi&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{\\Pi^*_{i,k}}(\\vec x)=x_{i-1}):\nk\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\},\\\\\nE_C&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\n(F_{C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m)}(\\vec x)=F_d(F_{e_1}(\\vec x),\\ldots,F_{e_m}(\\vec x))):\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}m,k\\ge1\\land d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\n\\land a(d)=m\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ a(e_i)=k)\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\},\\\\\nE_{R,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(F_{R(d,e)}(\\vec x,0)=F_d(\\vec x)):\nk\\ge1\\land d,e\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\land a(d)=k\\land a(e)=k+2\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\},\\\\\nE_{R,S}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\n(F_{R(d,e)}(\\vec x,S(u))=F_e(\\vec x,u,F_{R(d,e)}(\\vec x,u))):\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}k\\ge1\\land d,e\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\land a(d)=k\\land a(e)=k+2\n\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathcal V_k\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\setminus\\{x_i:i&lt;k\\}\\},\\\\\nE_{+,\\times}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}(\\theta):\nx,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\land x\\ne y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\theta\\in\\{x+0=x,\\ x+S(y)=S(x+y),\\ x\\times0=0,\\ x\\times S(y)=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq E_Z\\cup E_S\\cup E_\\Pi\\cup E_C\\cup E_{R,0}\\cup E_{R,S}\\cup E_{+,\\times}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall v_0\\ S(v_0)\\ne0,\\\n\\forall v_0\\forall v_1(S(v_0)=S(v_1)\\to v_0=v_1)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRA}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(L_{\\mathrm{PR}})+\n\\left(A_S\\cup\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\}\\right),\\\\\nPRA&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRA}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall v_0\\ S(v_0)\\ne0,\\\n\\forall v_0\\forall v_1(S(v_0)=S(v_1)\\to v_0=v_1)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRA}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(L_{\\mathrm{PR}})+\n\\left(A_S\\cup\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_{\\mathrm{PR}}}\\}\\right),\\\\\nPRA&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRA}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{QF}\">\\(L_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{QF}\\)</span> 的实际生成条件及后继的分离／单射公理；仅有定义方程和归纳而没有这些构造子条件会允许退化的一元模型，不是预期的算术。保留一阶逻辑加无量词归纳的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PRA\">\\(PRA\\)</span> 对象，不改成另一种纯等式推理系统。函数符号以有限定义描述呈示，避免把不可判定的外延函数相等作为语法判定前提；每个原始递归函数仍有相应符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"4c3a40ac2277e7d0","anch